run-roll.l4:97:1-98:35:
  EVERY's roll cannot mention the member it is drawing. The list after `elem` is read once, before there is any member to speak of, so it may not depend on one: write `WHO elem t tenants`, not `WHO elem t (peersOf t)`. To narrow the group by something about each member, put that in a further condition - `WHO elem t tenants AND isAdult t`.
